{"3868440": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "HowlKraul", "steam_appid": 3868440, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a fast-paced pixel-art dungeon crawler built around score chasing. Each run takes place in a single room that constantly feels fresh as its colors and enemies change. Defeat waves of foes, smash furniture for coins, and push your high score as far as you can. Play solo or team up with a friend, then compare end-of-run stats to see who really came out on top.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868440/extras/529b80131b00d7488dca297014d3f963.avif?t=1759269624\" width=875 height=161 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arcade-style dungeon crawler in pixel art</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic room with changing colors and enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Local solo or 2-player co-op</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >End-of-run stats to compete with your partner</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868440/extras/46cec7adfb8033e24b38bb783ec9b1f5.avif?t=1759269624\" width=1250 height=230 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect coins by smashing furniture or slay the dungeon inhabitants</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Carry your team in co-op and let the end of run stats show it wasn’t your fault you lost</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Climb into the top three on your local leaderboard</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"